---

<BlogArticleShell
  title="Jeans & denim on the Kakobuy Spreadsheet: 2026 lane guide (Corteiz, DSquared, fit) | kakobuy-cn.com"
  description="A data-backed guide to jeans rows on kakobuy-cn.com—30 deep-lane denim cards, brand clusters from Corteiz to Levi's, sizing QC, and freight notes before you paste into Kakobuy."
  canonicalPath={canonicalPath}
  headline="Jeans & denim lane guide: fit, batches, and freight on the Kakobuy Spreadsheet (2026)"
  publishedISO={publishedISO}
  displayDate="20 June 2026"
  structuredKeywords={[
    'Kakobuy Spreadsheet jeans',
    'Corteiz denim reps guide 2026',
    'DSQUARED2 jeans agent',
    'denim sizing spreadsheet',
    'kakobuy-cn.com pants lane',
  ]}
>
  <p class="blog-lede" slot="lede">
    Denim rows promise easy wardrobe wins—until waist sizing drifts two inches from the size chart, or a distressed wash looks nothing like the spreadsheet thumbnail.
    This guide maps the <strong><a href="/">Kakobuy Spreadsheet</a></strong> <code>jeans</code> pool as of <strong>30 June 2026</strong>: <strong>30 rows</strong> in the deep lane behind the homepage <a href="/category/pants/">Pants</a> shortcut, distinct from the wider <code>trousers-pants</code> pool.
  </p>

  <h2>June 2026 jeans snapshot</h2>
  <div class="blog-table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col">Metric</th><th scope="col">Jeans lane</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Deep-lane rows (<code>jeans</code>)</td><td>30</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Top labels (3 rows each)</td><td>Corteiz, DSQUARED2, Levi's</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Also indexed (2 rows each)</td><td>Gucci, Hellstar, Louis Vuitton, Moncler, Nike</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Homepage shortcut</td><td><a href="/category/pants/">Pants</a></td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>
    Counts come from our on-site English catalogue export. Brand strings reflect seller metadata, not authorised distribution.
    Tracksuit bottoms and cargo pants live in sibling pools—see <a href="/blog/kakobuy-tracksuits-pants-spreadsheet-lane-2026/">tracksuits &amp; pants guide</a> if you need non-denim bottoms.
  </p>

  <h2>What shoppers actually browse</h2>
  <h3>Streetwear denim (Corteiz, Hellstar)</h3>
  <p>
    <strong>Corteiz</strong> rows lead our snapshot—logo placement, patch alignment, and wash consistency matter more than on basics.
    QC focus: back-pocket embroidery, rivet branding, inseam measurements in warehouse stills.
  </p>
  <h3>Designer &amp; distressed (DSQUARED2, Gucci, Louis Vuitton)</h3>
  <p>
    <strong>DSQUARED2</strong> distressed silhouettes appear repeatedly; <strong>Gucci</strong> and <strong>Louis Vuitton</strong> denim trades on patch and monogram details.
    Compare whisker fading and knee distressing in <a href="/blog/kakobuy-4k-qc-video-inspection-guide/">4K QC video</a>—flat photos hide asymmetry.
  </p>
  <h3>Heritage basics (Levi's)</h3>
  <p>
    <strong>Levi's</strong> rows price lower in ¥ than luxury houses but still carry trademark strings on tabs and back patches.
    Do not assume “classic denim” equals unbranded postal lines.
  </p>

  <h2>QC &amp; sizing checklist</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Flat measurements:</strong> waist, rise, inseam, thigh—compare to haul #1 reference pants.</li>
    <li><strong>Wash &amp; distressing:</strong> symmetry left/right, colour match to listing photos.</li>
    <li><strong>Hardware:</strong> button engravings, rivet logos, zipper pull branding.</li>
    <li><strong>Interior tags:</strong> size confirmation before export approval.</li>
    <li><strong>Hem &amp; cuff:</strong> verify raw hem or stacking length if listing specifies.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>
    Pair with <a href="/blog/kakobuy-sizing-spreadsheet-apparel/">apparel sizing notes</a>—denim shrink and vanity sizing vary wildly by seller batch.
  </p>

  <h2>Freight notes</h2>
  <p>
    Jeans are freight-friendly compared to parkas—dense, low volumetric risk.
    Consolidate with hoodies and tees using <a href="/blog/kakobuy-rehearsal-packaging-freight/">rehearsal packaging</a> when building mixed apparel carts.
  </p>

  <h2>Browse workflow</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong><a href="/">Kakobuy Spreadsheet home</a></strong> → <a href="/category/pants/">Pants</a> → deep <code>jeans</code> pool.</li>
    <li>Copy live listing URLs—<a href="/blog/kakobuy-links-discovery-url-hygiene/">URL hygiene</a>.</li>
    <li>Freeze waist/length variants at paste time.</li>
    <li>Approve QC on measurements, not seller mannequin photos.</li>
    <li>Quote outbound freight before checkout.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>
    For the wider brand map see <a href="/blog/kakobuy-spreadsheet-brands-catalog-2026/">2026 brand catalogue</a> and <a href="/blog/kakobuy-spreadsheet-browse-navigation-guide/">browse guide</a>.
  </p>
